{
  "_comment": [
    "Recorded shapes of Esplora (mempool.space) answers, rewritten onto the PUBLIC BIP84 test-vector",
    "wallet ('abandon abandon ... about', m/84'/0'/0') - never a real user's addresses, as an on-chain",
    "address can't be anonymized afterwards. The two confirmed shapes that matter (an incoming receive and",
    "an outgoing spend with change) keep the satoshi values of the transactions they were recorded from;",
    "the self-move, the dust attack and the unconfirmed transaction are constructed, as no wallet",
    "validated so far has one.",
    "The account key is deliberately serialized with 'xpub' version bytes although the account is BIP84:",
    "that is what a real exporter did, and it is what the script-type detection has to survive."
  ],
